{"id":"dba31c144607e57b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-countable.md","title":"Countable Set","display":"df-countable — Countable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-countable","aliases":["88-df-countable"],"display":"df-countable — Countable Set","depends_on":["[[88-df-cardinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-countable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-countable — Countable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\in V\">\\(A \\in V\\)</span> (set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> (cardinality, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3fb55f9cf4d73400\" href=\"?note=3fb55f9cf4d73400\" title=\"88-df-cardinality\">88-df-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}(A)\\)</span> (countability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Countable}(A) \\leftrightarrow |A| \\leq \\omega\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable} \\vdash \\mathrm{Countable}(A) \\leftrightarrow |A| \\leq \\omega\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A| \\leq \\omega\">\\(|A| \\leq \\omega\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>的基数不超过可数无穷</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega = |\\mathbb{N}|\">\\(\\omega = |\\mathbb{N}|\\)</span> : 自然数集的基数</li>\n<li>可数集包括有限集和可数无穷集</li>\n<li>Löwenheim--Skolem 定理在可数语言且理论可满足时保证存在可数模型；\n仅有“理论可数”不足以推出存在模型。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" href=\"?note=4df32d0a7ee8d3b6\" title=\"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem\">88-thm-lowenheim-skolem</a> — Löwenheim-Skolem定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a> — 结构</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eeb525258b84dd0c\" href=\"?note=eeb525258b84dd0c\" title=\"88-fact-tm-countable\">88-fact-tm-countable</a> — 图灵机可数性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"3fb55f9cf4d73400","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|A|$ (cardinality, see [[88-df-cardinality]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-lowenheim-skolem","status":"resolved","id":"4df32d0a7ee8d3b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"[[88-thm-lowenheim-skolem]] — Löwenheim-Skolem定理","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","l